<title>JAPAN: Shiraishi - 96/97 group results.</title>
<headline>Shiraishi - 96/97 group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 70.81		vs	   62.10</p>
<p> Operating	    1.70		vs	    1.51</p>
<p> Current		1.41		vs	    1.18</p>
<p> Net		  489    million	  vs	  203    million</p>
<p> EPS		   27.42 yen	  vs	   12.51 yen</p>
